# Runtime env for the frontend (web) container.
#
# ⚠️ VITE_* is NOT read here. Vite inlines VITE_API_URL into the JS bundle when
# the Docker image is built (.github/workflows/deploy.yml → *_PROD secrets).
#
# To change the live API host:
#   1. Settings → Secrets → VITE_API_URL_PROD / VITE_GRAPHQL_ENDPOINT_PROD
#   2. Rebuild via tag or Actions → Deploy → Run workflow
#   3. Pull/restart frontend on the server
#
# Only non-VITE server-side runtime vars belong in this file (if any).
